Subject: [PATCH 141/143] regulator: add opt-in A22x stock RF LDO LP
 initialization

---
 drivers/regulator/mt6359-a22x-lp-init-core.h | 156 +++++++++++++++++++
 drivers/regulator/mt6359-a22x-lp-init.h      | 105 +++++++++++++
 drivers/regulator/mt6359-regulator.c         |   6 +
 3 files changed, 267 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 drivers/regulator/mt6359-a22x-lp-init-core.h
